  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "TPKT: Call it continuation if the length is bogus",
  "description": "dissect_tpkt_encap assumes that we have Continuation Data if\nthe first byte is not the valid version number (3). That's a\nfairly weak heuristic, so if the length is illegal (i.e., < 4,\nsince the length includes the 4 octet TPKT header), also call it\nContinuation Data for the same reason.\n\nSee #20884",
